  "Texts": {
    "LWN_coop_plan_talk_method": {
      "en": "My part: I will get close and try to keep the guard talking. A conversation may draw his attention, but does not give us permission to enter. I will check the gate and signal only if there is a real opening.",
      "zh": "我的办法：先走近，找话跟守卫多聊几句，把他的注意力牵住。聊上了也不等于肯放行；我会看门口的实际情况，有空当才给你信号。"
    },
    "LWN_coop_plan_investigate_method": {
      "en": "My part: I will ask the guard to investigate. He still has a post to cover and needs a real replacement before leaving. If that cannot be arranged, I will stop; only a confirmed opening earns our signal.",
      "zh": "我的办法：过去请守卫核查。不过他还有岗位要守，接替的人真到岗了才肯走。等不到接替，这条路就走不通；我确认有空当了才给你信号。"
    },
    "LWN_coop_stage_lure": {
      "en": "trying the cargo story on a guard",
      "zh": "拿藏货的借口试探守卫"
    },
    "LWN_coop_stage_lead": {
      "en": "leading the guards to the reported spot",
      "zh": "亲自带守卫去查看"
    },
    "LWN_coop_stage_follow": {
      "en": "following the person who reported the cargo",
      "zh": "跟着报信的人走"
    },
    "LWN_coop_stage_report": {
      "en": "returning to explain why this attempt stopped",
      "zh": "回来说明这次为什么没成"
    },
    "LWN_coop_plan_lure_method": {
      "en": "My part: I will make up a report of untaxed cargo outside the gate. They cannot simply abandon their post, so I will argue that one must check the goods while the other keeps the carrier from running. I will speak to each guard; only if both agree will I lead them down the lane. Once both arrive, I will check the gate before giving you our signal.",
      "zh": "我的办法：编个门外藏着漏税货的说辞。他们不会平白丢下岗位，我就拿查货这桩差事说动他们：一个验货，一个看住搬货的人。我会分别把话说到，两人都答应了才亲自带路；等他们都到了巷口，再看门口有没有空当。"
    },
    "LWN_coop_line_ask_lure": {
      "en": "Someone has hidden untaxed cargo down the lane. Come with me: one of you can watch him while the other checks the goods.",
      "zh": "外面巷口有人藏着没交税的货。我带路，你们一个看住人，一个查货。"
    },
    "LWN_coop_line_ask_lure_gate_sentry": {
      "en": "There is a fellow carrying sacks behind the low wall outside. He hid when he saw the gate guards. Looks like he is dodging the toll.",
      "zh": "韩大哥，门外矮墙后有人搬麻袋，看见守门的就躲。像是在绕城门的税。"
    },
    "LWN_coop_line_challenge_gate_sentry": {
      "en": "We have a gate to watch. You say it looks suspicious; what did you actually see?",
      "zh": "门还得守着。你说像，那到底看见什么了？"
    },
    "LWN_coop_line_clarify_gate_sentry": {
      "en": "Two sacks so heavy he could barely stand. I will show you myself. One of you checks the goods and the other keeps him there; he could run if you go alone.",
      "zh": "两个麻袋，压得那人直不起腰。我亲自领你过去；你们一个验货，一个看住人，单去一个，他扔下货跑了怎么办？"
    },
    "LWN_coop_line_accept_gate_sentry": {
      "en": "Checking untaxed goods is part of the job too. Tell the others first. We will take a quick look outside, then return if there is no evidence. Stay where we can see you.",
      "zh": "查漏税货也是差事。先跟其他人说清楚，只去门外看一眼，没凭据就回来。你不许乱跑。"
    },
    "LWN_coop_line_ask_lure_blocker": {
      "en": "There is someone hiding untaxed cargo just outside, captain. A man checking the sacks cannot watch the carrier as well. We need you to keep him from running.",
      "zh": "罗大哥，门外巷口有人藏漏税的货。光顾着查麻袋，人就跑了，得你过去镇住。"
    },
    "LWN_coop_line_challenge_blocker": {
      "en": "If someone goes to check the goods, I watch the gate. You want both of us away? What are you playing at?",
      "zh": "有人去查货，我就得看门。想让我们两个都走，你小子打什么主意？"
    },
    "LWN_coop_line_clarify_blocker": {
      "en": "Just the lane outside, a few steps away. I will lead and stay with you. If there are no goods, you can bring me back and make me answer for it.",
      "zh": "就在门外巷口，几步的事，我给你领路。真找不着货，你把我带回来问，跑不了我的。"
    },
    "LWN_coop_line_accept_blocker": {
      "en": "Fine. Checking goods and keeping suspects here are our jobs as well. Tell everyone first, then walk ahead. We look and come straight back. Lie to us and you answer for it.",
      "zh": "行，查货扣人也归我们管。先把其他人叫上，你走前头，看完马上回来。敢扯谎，这笔账找你算。"
    },
    "LWN_coop_line_accept_lure": {
      "en": "Wait here until you have told the others. Then lead the way; we will see what is there.",
      "zh": "先把话跟其他人说明白，再带路。我去看看，别耍花样。"
    },
    "LWN_coop_line_refuse_lure": {
      "en": "You want us all away from the gate? I do not trust this story. Move along.",
      "zh": "想把我们都支走？这话我信不过。别在这儿绕了。"
    },
    "LWN_coop_line_look_cargo": {
      "en": "This is the place? Point out the sacks. Stay here while we check, and do not touch anything.",
      "zh": "就是这儿？麻袋指给我看。你站住别乱碰，我们查完就回岗。"
    },
    "LWN_coop_line_failed": {
      "en": "I could not make this work. Keep clear of the gate for now; we will need another way.",
      "zh": "这办法没走通，门口还不能放心过去。我先回来，咱们换个办法。"
    },
    "LWN_coop_plan_failure": {
      "en": "If it fails: if anyone refuses, cannot follow, or turns back before there is an opening, stay outside. I will stop, return to explain and wait at my old place. I will not pay or start a fight on my own.",
      "zh": "没成怎么办：有人不信、跟不上，或还没露出空当就回头，你先别往门里冲。我会收住这次尝试，回来把缘由说清楚，再回原处等你。不会擅自加钱或动手。"
    },
    "LWN_coop_plan_rendezvous": {
      "en": "After the signal: I will stay here to hold their attention while you cross. Once I see you through, my part is done. You do not need to wait for me to reach you; find me later if you need more help.",
      "zh": "后续安排：给了信号，我还留在这里牵住他们，你自己过门。看见你过去了，这次帮忙就算办成；不用等我再走到你身边，之后有事再来找我。"
    },
    "LWN_coop_result_success": {
      "en": "You are through the gate. My part is done.",
      "zh": "看见你过门了，这次帮忙办成了。"
    },
    "LWN_coop_line_signal": {
      "en": "I gesture for you to cross while the gate is clear.",
      "zh": "我朝门口比了个手势：趁空当过去。"
    },
    "LWN_coop_plan_player_task": {
      "en": "Your part: wait outside and keep an eye on me. Once I have drawn their attention and confirmed an opening, I will gesture toward the gate. That is your cue to slip through yourself; a guard who turns back can still see you.",
      "zh": "你怎么配合：先留在门外，别跟着我走。等我牵住他们的注意力、也确认门口有空当，就朝门口打手势。看见信号，你再自己贴着没被盯住的地方过去；他们随时可能回头。"
    },
    "LWN_coop_plan_waiting_signal": {
      "en": "You saw my gesture. Watch the gate and cross while the opening lasts.",
      "zh": "你看见了我的手势；看准门口的空当再过去。"
    },
    "LWN_coop_signal_received": {
      "en": "{ACTOR} signals toward the gate: cross now while the opening lasts. Keep out of sight.",
      "zh": "{ACTOR}朝门口打了手势：现在有空当，赶紧过去，别撞进守卫的视线。"
    },
    "LWN_coop_plan_risk": {
      "en": "The risk: they may refuse or turn back while checking. If I use a made-up report, finding no goods will make them suspicious. My signal only tells you what I can see at that moment; it is not permission to enter.",
      "zh": "风险：他们可能不信，也可能中途回头。拿编造的藏货作借口，查不出东西还会让他们起疑。我的手势只说这会儿看见了空当，不是拿到了通行许可。"
    },
    "LWN_coop_plan_cost": {
      "en": "Our agreement: I will try the talk we agreed on. I will not pay extra or start a fight. You can call it off; events already set in motion still stand.",
      "zh": "约定：我替你试这次口头交涉，不额外花钱，也不动武。你可以叫停；已经引起的事情收不回来。"
    },
    "LWN_coop_prompt_polish": {
      "en": "Rewrite this fixed local plan as a concise briefing spoken by its named actor to the player. In plain, characterful language explain the objective, why the tactic could work, who does what, the actual signal and timing, the conditions for withdrawing, and when the assistance ends. The actor holds their attention in place while the player crosses; meeting the player is not required. Do not list algorithm stages or pretend future steps have succeeded. Preserve all named targets, uncertainty, costs and risk. Do not add actions, evidence, permission, money or combat. Return only JSON with one text string, no more than 240 words.",
      "zh": "把这份已确定的本地计划改写成执行者向玩家当面交代的行动安排。用符合人物身份的口语，讲清要办什么、说辞为什么可能奏效、双方怎么分工、看到什么信号才能行动、什么情况撤回、何时结束协助。执行者留在原处牵制，玩家自行过门，不要求走到玩家身边会合。不要堆算法阶段，不把准备尝试写成已经成功。保留实际对象、未知、代价和风险；不增添动作、证据、通行许可、付款或战斗。只返回含一个text字符串字段的JSON，正文不超过240字。"
    },
    "LWN_story_son_coop_depart_temp": {
      "en": "Let me explain my plan first; I will go when you agree.",
      "zh": "我先把打算跟你说清楚，你点头了我再去。"
    },
    "LWN_story_son_coop_depart_paid": {
      "en": "Let me explain my plan first; I will go when you agree.",
      "zh": "我先把打算跟你说清楚，你点头了我再去。"
    },
    "LWN_story_son_coop_depart_charm": {
      "en": "Let me explain my plan first; I will go when you agree.",
      "zh": "我先把打算跟你说清楚，你点头了我再去。"
    },
    "LWN_story_son_coop_member_ready": {
      "en": "Let me explain my plan first; I will go when you agree.",
      "zh": "我先把打算跟你说清楚，你点头了我再去。"
    }
  }
}
